    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>as a packing unit for dry goods | bundle as a packing unit (measure?) of brown paper | as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | of bowstaves | of brown paper | of flax | of paper | of rods | bundle as a packing unit (measure?) of paper | bundle as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | as a packing unit for flax (equivalent to 7 lb.) | as a packing unit for stockfish | as a packing unit for welde (q.v.) | as a measure of Cologne thread | as a measure of Prussia thread | as a measure of flax | as a packing unit of iron | as a packing unit of latten plate | as a packing unit for iron | as a packing unit for silk | as a packing unit for woad | bundle, as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | a packing unit for fagotte iron, containing 5 hundred at 112 lb. | bundle, a unit of packaging | bundle, a unit of packing, for iron, flax | bundle, a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | a packing unit for dried fish | a packing unit for paper | a packing unit for rods | a packing unit for thread | a packing unit for wire | as a packing unit of bast (q.v.) | as a packing unit (measure?) of niger paper (q.v.) | of bast | of garlic | of kettle bands (q.v.) | of Prussian canvas | bundle, a unit of packing for dry goods | bundle, a unit of packing for dry goods, here of silk, also of thread, wire, white rods, dry plaice, rabbit skins | bundle, a unit of measure of silk | as a measure of silk (sericum calle, sericum Colonie) | bundle, a unit of packing for dry goods of no particular size | as a measure of paper (brown paper, black paper) | a packing unit for bowstaves, containing 16 staves | bundle, a unit of packing for dry goods of no particular size, here of black paper | small bundle, here of rods | bunch, bundle as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size (OED s.v. bond I.4) | bunch, bundle (OED s.v. bond I 4)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
